l is a delivery-only handshake and is never persisted, so it does not appear here. For the full list of events and the live delivery envelope, see the ",[215,216,217],"a",{"href":39},"Webhooks guide",".",[220,221,223],"h3",{"id":222},"properties","Properties",[225,226,227,243],"table",{},[228,229,230],"thead",{},[231,232,233,237,240],"tr",{},[234,235,236],"th",{},"Name",[234,238,239],{},"Type",[234,241,242],{},"Description",[244,245,246,266,283,309,340,354,384,398,413],"tbody",{},[231,247,248,254,259],{},[249,250,251],"td",{},[210,252,253],{},"id",[249,255,256],{},[210,257,258],{},"string",[249,260,261,262,265],{},"Unique identifier for the webhook event (starts with ",[210,263,264],{},"webhook_event_",").",[231,267,268,273,277],{},[249,269,270],{},[210,271,272],{},"resource",[249,274,275],{},[210,276,258],{},[249,278,279,280,218],{},"The resource type. Always ",[210,281,282],{},"webhook_event",[231,284,285,290,294],{},[249,286,287],{},[210,288,289],{},"eventName",[249,291,292],{},[210,293,258],{},[249,295,296,297,300,301,304,305,308],{},"The event name, such as ",[210,298,299],{},"order.paid"," or ",[210,302,303],{},"refund.completed",". See the ",[215,306,217],{"href":307},"/guides/webhooks#event-types"," for the full list.",[231,310,311,316,320],{},[249,312,313],{},[210,314,315],{},"entityType",[249,317,318],{},[210,319,258],{},[249,321,322,323,326,327,326,330,326,333,336,337,218],{},"The resource type the event refers to, such as ",[210,324,325],{},"order",", ",[210,328,329],{},"refund",[210,331,332],{},"chargeback",[210,334,335],{},"subscription",", or ",[210,338,339],{},"checkout",[231,341,342,347,351],{},[249,343,344],{},[210,345,346],{},"entityId",[249,348,349],{},[210,350,258],{},[249,352,353],{},"The ID of the related resource.",[231,355,356,361,365],{},[249,357,358],{},[210,359,360],{},"object",[249,362,363],{},[210,364,360],{},[249,366,367,368,370,371,374,375,377,378,381,382,218],{},"The full resource payload as it existed when the event occurred (an Order, Chargeback, Refund, Subscription, or Checkout), keyed by its own ",[210,369,272],{}," field. Note ",[210,372,373],{},"object.resource"," can differ from ",[210,376,315],{},": chargeback events carry ",[210,379,380],{},"entityType: order"," but a Chargeback ",[210,383,360],{},[231,385,386,391,395],{},[249,387,388],{},[210,389,390],{},"createdAt",[249,392,393],{},[210,394,258],{},[249,396,397],{},"When the event occurred (ISO 8601 format).",[231,399,400,405,410],{},[249,401,402],{},[210,403,404],{},"testmode",[249,406,407],{},[210,408,409],{},"boolean",[249,411,412],{},"Whether the event originated from a test-mode resource.",[231,414,415,420,424],{},[249,416,417],{},[210,418,419],{},"links",[249,421,422],{},[210,423,360],{},[249,425,426,427,218],{},"HATEOAS links. Contains ",[210,428,429],{},"self",[431,432],"hr",{},[196,434,436],{"id":435},"get-a-webhook-event","Get a webhook event",[201,438,439],{},[210,440,441],{},"GET /v1/webhook-events/:eventId",[201,443,444],{},"This endpoint returns the full webhook event payload for a specific event ID.",[220,446,448],{"id":447},"parameters","Parameters",[225,450,451,461],{},[228,452,453],{},[231,454,455,457,459],{},[234,456,236],{},[234,458,239],{},[234,460,242],{},[244,462,463],{},[231,464,465,470,474],{},[249,466,467],{},[210,468,469],{},"eventId",[249,471,472],{},[210,473,258],{},[249,475,476],{},"The unique identifier of the webhook event.",[478,479,481,523,637],"code-group",{"sync":480},"api",[482,483,488],"pre",{"className":484,"code":485,"filename":486,"language":487,"meta":109,"style":109},"language-bash shiki shiki-themes material-theme-lighter material-theme material-theme-palenight","curl https://api.vatly.com/v1/webhook-events/webhook_event_Qk8pRtSvWm2NjLhYcZaE \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer live_your_api_key_here\"\n","cURL","bash",[210,489,490,507],{"__ignoreMap":109},[491,492,495,499,503],"span",{"class":493,"line":494},"line",1,[491,496,498],{"class":497},"sBMFI","curl",[491,500,502],{"class":501},"sfaz